 bgslibrary  algorithms  
 
knn  knn     
  ibgs quote knn    
  history 10   dist2threshold 20 0f   20 0f   shadowthreshold 0 5f  
  
  debug construction knn   
  initloadsaveconfig algorithmname   
  
 
knn   knn     
  debug destruction knn knn  process cv  mat  img input  cv  mat  img output  cv  mat  img bgmodel  
  
  init img input  img output  img bgmodel firsttime  
    knn   cv  createbackgroundsubtractorknn      
 
  knn- sethistory history   
  knn- setdist2threshold dist2threshold   
  knn- setshadowthreshold shadowthreshold   
 
    
  knn- apply img input  img foreground   
  knn- getbackgroundimage img background showoutput    
    cv  imshow algorithmname     fg   img foreground   
    cv  imshow algorithmname     bg   img background   
    
  
 
  img foreground copyto img output   
  img background copyto img bgmodel   
 
  firsttime knn  save config cv  filestorage  fs    
  fs     history     history  
  fs     dist2threshold     dist2threshold  
  fs     shadowthreshold     shadowthreshold  
  fs     showoutput     showoutput knn  load config cv  filestorage  fs    
  fs  history      history  
  fs  dist2threshold      dist2threshold  
  fs  shadowthreshold      shadowthreshold  
  fs  showoutput      showoutput  
  
 
